[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7201.83, "timestamp": "02:00:01", "text": "そしてそれは戦争と呼ばれる一人の人物に終わった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7204.87, "timestamp": "02:00:04", "text": "サンダーズブラフは、お金を支払った。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7207.75, "timestamp": "02:00:07", "text": "2万ドルくらいだったかな。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7211.83, "timestamp": "02:00:11", "text": "何てことだ。そして一日で誰かが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7213.87, "timestamp": "02:00:13", "text": "4回の取引を行った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7218.03, "timestamp": "02:00:18", "text": "War Thunderのアイテムを手に入れるのに5,000ドル相当"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7220.35, "timestamp": "02:00:20", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "OH. My. god"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7221.03, "timestamp": "02:00:21", "text": "2万ドル。そしてWar ThunderのWar"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7222.55, "timestamp": "02:00:22", "text": "そもそも、彼らはそんなことをするつもりは全くなかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7223.75, "timestamp": "02:00:23", "text": "彼らは決してそれを譲るつもりはなかった。そうだった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7226.31, "timestamp": "02:00:26", "text": "エイプリルフールのジョークです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7229.43, "timestamp": "02:00:29", "text": "わかった。しかし、何らかの愚かな理由で、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7231.589, "timestamp": "02:00:31", "text": "金融メカニズム全体が確実に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7233.589, "timestamp": "02:00:33", "text": "その背後には、セットが組まれていた。支払うことができるように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7238.95, "timestamp": "02:00:38", "text": "そして彼らは「いや、誰も行かないよ」と言った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7240.47, "timestamp": "02:00:40", "text": "「それをやるために。」すると誰かがこう言った。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7243.51, "timestamp": "02:00:43", "text": "「いいか、やってみるよ。」"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7246.79, "timestamp": "02:00:46", "text": "そしてその人は2万ドル相当のものを現金化した"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7249.91, "timestamp": "02:00:49", "text": "それを支払うための株式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7252.31, "timestamp": "02:00:52", "text": "何てことだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7254.39, "timestamp": "02:00:54", "text": "そしてWar Thunderは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7255.99, "timestamp": "02:00:55", "text": "彼らにお金が振り込まれる。彼らは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7257.589, "timestamp": "02:00:57", "text": "「ああ、やばい、いや、いや、いや、いや、いや、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7259.189, "timestamp": "02:00:59", "text": "いや、いや。"}]